\c 4
\s1 Footnotes and cross references
\p
\v 1 Then the man knew Eve his wife,\f + \fr 4:1 \fk knew \ft means to be intimate.\fdc Apocryphal context.\f* and she conceived.
\v 2 Again she bore his brother Abel.\fe + \ft Extended-format footnote.\fe*
\v 3 In the course of time\f + \fq selected text \fqa alt rendering \fv 3\fv* \fp paragraph break inside note. \fl label\fl* \fm material\fm* \fw witness\fw*\f*
\v 4 Cain brought an offering.\x - \xo 4:4 \xt Heb 11:4\x*
\v 5 But Abel’s offering pleased the LORD.\x - \xo 4:5 \xq selected\xq* \xk keyword\xk* \xta target attribute\xta* \xot OT ref\xot* \xnt NT ref\xnt* \xdc DC ref\xdc* \xop Pub origin\xop*\x*
\v 6 Inline nested character markers inside a note\f + \fr 4:6 \ft Cited in \+xt Matt 19:4\+xt* and \+nd Lord\+nd*.\f*.
\v 7 Alternate note kinds: \ef + \ft extended footnote variant.\ef* \ex - \ft extended xref variant.\ex*

\c 5
\s1 Character markers
\p
\v 1 \nd Lord\nd*, \bk Genesis\bk*, \add added\add*, \addpn referent\addpn*, \bd bold\bd*, \bdit bold-italic\bdit*, \it italic\it*, \em emphasized\em*, \sc small-caps\sc*, \sup super\sup*.
\v 2 \dc deuterocanonical\dc*, \k keyword\k*, \no normal\no*, \ord 1st\ord*, \pn proper name\pn*, \png geographic\png*, \qac acrostic char\qac*, \qs Selah\qs*, \qt quoted\qt*, \rb ruby|gloss="gloss"\rb*.
\v 3 \sig signature\sig*, \sls Selah-style\sls*, \tl transliterated\tl*, \w word|lemma="lemma"\w*, \wa Aramaic\wa*, \wg Greek\wg*, \wh Hebrew\wh*, \wj words of Jesus\wj*, \wl wordlist|index="x"\wl*.
\v 4 Inline references and pronunciation: \rq inline ref\rq*, \jmp jump-link|link-href="#x"\jmp*, \pro pronunciation\pro*, \ref Gen 1:1\ref*, \iqt intro quoted\iqt*, \ior outline ref\ior*, \vp 4a\vp*, \va 4a\va*.
\v 5 Optional break before pronunciation//transliteration. Two  spaces  inside  text  preserved.

\c 6
\s1 Milestones
\p
\v 1 Quotation milestones single-level: \qt-s |sid="qt.6.1.1" who="God"\*Be fruitful.\qt-e |eid="qt.6.1.1"\*
\v 2 Numbered quotations nested: \qt1-s |sid="qt1.6.2" who="Outer"\*Outer says \qt2-s |sid="qt2.6.2"\*Inner says \qt3-s |sid="qt3.6.2"\*Deeper \qt4-s |sid="qt4.6.2"\*Deeper still \qt5-s |sid="qt5.6.2"\*Deepest\qt5-e |eid="qt5.6.2"\*\qt4-e |eid="qt4.6.2"\*\qt3-e |eid="qt3.6.2"\*\qt2-e |eid="qt2.6.2"\*\qt1-e |eid="qt1.6.2"\*
\v 3 Translator section standalone: \ts\*
\v 4 Translator section paired: \ts-s |sid="ts.6.4"\*chunk body\ts-e |eid="ts.6.4"\*
\v 5 Table milestone paired: \t-s |sid="t.6.5"\*table body\t-e |eid="t.6.5"\*
\v 6 List and table 3.2 milestones: \list |sid="list.6.6"\* contents \table |sid="table.6.6"\*
\v 7 Verse-in-document milestones: \vid 6:7\vid* \vid-s |sid="vid.6.7"\*body\vid-e |eid="vid.6.7"\*

